# QRPick opportunity classification

자동 분류는 지원 가능 여부를 확정하기 위한 것이 아니다.
직접 적합·상세확인·영업판로·오탐 위험을 구분하고, 사람이 다음 행동을 결정하도록 돕는다.

## Required separation

- **Relevance**: `primary_asset_fit_path`, `secondary_asset_fit_paths`, `matched_asset_families`, `fit_confidence`, `fit_evidence`
- **Action**: `action_queue`, `recommended_next_action`

Do not collapse everything into DETAIL_REVIEW or SHOWDA_ASSET_REUSE.

## Hard gates

- `SHOWDA_ASSET_REUSE` only with explicit `matched_asset_families` evidence (never AI/플랫폼/데이터 alone).
- `CUSTOM_BUILD_SERVICE` only with explicit build/ops keywords.
- Industry labels alone never force exclusion.
- No per-announcement title hardcoding.

## Action queues

`ACTION_NOW` | `QUALIFICATION_CHECK` | `SALES_OUTREACH` | `WATCHLIST` | `NO_ACTION` | `CLOSED`

Exhibition participant recruitment → sales/watchlist, not “detail dump only”.
Personal trainee education → `NO_ACTION`.

